{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "tagalng-guest-onboarding-full",
    "name": "TagAlng — Guest onboarding (in-chat Maria → OTP → intro)",
    "description": "Full Lana-first guest flow — **everything in chat** until OTP, then finish profile + intro.\n\n**Environment:** `TagAlng — tagalng-dev` · set `anon_key`\n\n**Prerequisites:** Anonymous sign-ins · Manual linking · migration `20260617120000_joint_moment_onboarding.sql` · lana-worker deployed\n\n**Run 1 → 13 in order.** OTP: step 6 links phone (no separate /otp call). Step 7 verify uses `type: phone_change`. Use a **fresh** `test_phone` each run (e.g. `+15550999012`). Dev OTP: `000000`.\n\nSee `docs/GUEST_ONBOARDING_FLOW.md` for the conversation script.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Phase 1 — Anonymous + Lana (Maria in chat)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Anonymous sign-in",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "const j = pm.response.json();",
                "function jwtSub(t) {",
                "  const p = JSON.parse(atob(t.split('.')[1].replace(/-/g,'+').replace(/_/g,'/')));",
                "  return p.sub;",
                "}",
                "if (j.access_token) {",
                "  pm.environment.set('access_token', j.access_token);",
                "  pm.environment.set('guest_user_id', jwtSub(j.access_token));",
                "}",
                "if (j.refresh_token) pm.environment.set('refresh_token', j.refresh_token);",
                "pm.test('anonymous', () => pm.expect(j.user.is_anonymous).to.eql(true));"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{anon_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{anon_key}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{}" },
            "url": "{{supabase_url}}/auth/v1/signup"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Start Lana session",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "const j = pm.response.json();",
                "if (j.session_id) pm.environment.set('lana_session_id', j.session_id);",
                "pm.test('guest session', () => {",
                "  pm.expect(j.is_anonymous).to.eql(true);",
                "  pm.expect(j.onboarding_step).to.eql('early_chat');",
                "});"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"purpose\": \"profile_intake\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{lana_worker_url}}/lana/sessions"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Lana — life stage (triggers Maria offer)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "const j = pm.response.json();",
                "if (j.joint_moment && j.joint_moment.joint_moment_id) {",
                "  pm.environment.set('joint_moment_id', j.joint_moment.joint_moment_id);",
                "}",
                "if (j.joint_moment && j.joint_moment.candidate && j.joint_moment.candidate.user_id) {",
                "  pm.environment.set('maria_user_id', j.joint_moment.candidate.user_id);",
                "}",
                "pm.test('Maria offered in chat', () => {",
                "  pm.expect(j.onboarding_step).to.eql('offered_intro');",
                "  pm.expect(j.assistant_message.toLowerCase()).to.include('maria');",
                "});"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"message\": \"{{guest_message_life_stage}}\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{lana_worker_url}}/lana/sessions/{{lana_session_id}}/messages"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Lana — yes introduce us",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "const j = pm.response.json();",
                "pm.test('asks intro name', () => {",
                "  pm.expect(j.onboarding_step).to.eql('awaiting_intro_name');",
                "  pm.expect(j.assistant_message.toLowerCase()).to.include('call you');",
                "});"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"message\": \"{{guest_message_yes}}\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{lana_worker_url}}/lana/sessions/{{lana_session_id}}/messages"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Lana — intro name",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "const j = pm.response.json();",
                "if (j.joint_moment && j.joint_moment.joint_moment_id) {",
                "  pm.environment.set('joint_moment_id', j.joint_moment.joint_moment_id);",
                "}",
                "pm.test('await phone', () => {",
                "  pm.expect(j.onboarding_step).to.eql('await_phone');",
                "  pm.expect(j.requires_phone_verification).to.eql(true);",
                "});"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"message\": \"{{guest_intro_name}}\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{lana_worker_url}}/lana/sessions/{{lana_session_id}}/messages"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Phase 2 — Phone OTP",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "6. Link phone (sends OTP to anonymous user)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "pm.test('phone linked on same user', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                "pm.test('still anonymous until verify', () => {",
                "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                "  pm.expect(j.is_anonymous).to.eql(true);",
                "});"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{anon_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{test_phone}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{supabase_url}}/auth/v1/user",
            "description": "Links phone to the **anonymous** user (same user_id as Lana session). Supabase sends OTP automatically. Do NOT call /auth/v1/otp — that is sign-in and creates a different user."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "7. Verify OTP (phone_change — keeps same user_id)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "const j = pm.response.json();",
                "function jwtSub(t) {",
                "  const p = JSON.parse(atob(t.split('.')[1].replace(/-/g,'+').replace(/_/g,'/')));",
                "  return p.sub;",
                "}",
                "if (j.access_token) pm.environment.set('access_token', j.access_token);",
                "if (j.refresh_token) pm.environment.set('refresh_token', j.refresh_token);",
                "const guestId = pm.environment.get('guest_user_id');",
                "pm.test('verified', () => pm.expect(j.access_token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
                "pm.test('same user_id as Lana session', () => {",
                "  pm.expect(jwtSub(j.access_token)).to.eql(guestId);",
                "});",
                "pm.test('no longer anonymous', () => pm.expect(j.user.is_anonymous).to.eql(false));"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{anon_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{anon_key}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{test_phone}}\",\n  \"token\": \"{{test_otp}}\",\n  \"type\": \"phone_change\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{supabase_url}}/auth/v1/verify",
            "description": "CRITICAL: type must be phone_change (not sms). sms = sign-in → new/different user → session_not_found on Lana."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Phase 3 — Resume Lana + complete profile",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "8. Lana — after OTP (kids question)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "const j = pm.response.json();",
                "pm.test('post verify', () => {",
                "  pm.expect(j.onboarding_step).to.eql('post_verify');",
                "  pm.expect(j.phone_verified).to.eql(true);",
                "});"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"message\": \"{{guest_message_post_otp}}\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{lana_worker_url}}/lana/sessions/{{lana_session_id}}/messages"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "9. Lana — kids ages",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"message\": \"{{guest_message_kids}}\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{lana_worker_url}}/lana/sessions/{{lana_session_id}}/messages"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "10. Lana — interests",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"message\": \"{{guest_message_interests}}\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{lana_worker_url}}/lana/sessions/{{lana_session_id}}/messages"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "11. Lana — complete profile",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "const j = pm.response.json();",
                "pm.test('profile completed', () => pm.expect(j.status).to.eql('completed'));",
                "pm.test('claims saved', () => pm.expect(j.claims.length).to.be.above(0));"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"force\": true\n}" },
            "url": "{{lana_worker_url}}/lana/sessions/{{lana_session_id}}/complete"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Phase 4 — Block + send intro to Maria",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "12. assign_home_block (Maria's block)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "pm.test('block assigned', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{anon_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"p_lat\": 28.3647,\n  \"p_lng\": -81.2568\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{supabase_url}}/rest/v1/rpc/assign_home_block"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "13. send_joint_moment_intro",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "const j = pm.response.json();",
                "if (j.nudge_id) pm.environment.set('nudge_id', j.nudge_id);",
                "pm.test('intro sent', () => pm.expect(j.status).to.eql('intro_sent'));"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{anon_key}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"p_joint_moment_id\": \"{{joint_moment_id}}\",\n  \"p_opener_text\": \"Hi Maria — Lana thought we should meet!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{supabase_url}}/rest/v1/rpc/send_joint_moment_intro"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Optional — resume mid-flow",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET session state",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{lana_worker_url}}/lana/sessions/{{lana_session_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Lana — send any message",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "const j = pm.response.json();",
                "if (j.joint_moment && j.joint_moment.joint_moment_id) {",
                "  pm.environment.set('joint_moment_id', j.joint_moment.joint_moment_id);",
                "}",
                "console.log('onboarding_step:', j.onboarding_step);",
                "console.log('requires_phone_verification:', j.requires_phone_verification);"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"message\": \"ok\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{lana_worker_url}}/lana/sessions/{{lana_session_id}}/messages"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
